  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Mwandzo 32",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "32",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye Jakobo naye wauka. Mo njirani wakutana na malaika a Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphoaona hara malaika waamba, “Hiri ni jeshi ra Mlungu.” Phahi phatu hipho achiphaiha Mahanaimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mahanaimu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kpwa Chieburania manaye ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kambi mbiri za majeshi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo wahuma ajumbe chimbere kuphiya kpwa Esau hiko Seiri, kahi za tsi ya Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waalagiza achiaamba, “Muambireni bwana wangu Esau hivi: Mtumishio Jakobo anaamba, ‘Násagala na aphu Labani miaka iyo yosi hadi rero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vivi nina ngʼombe, punda, mbuzi na mangʼondzi na atumwa alume na achetu. Nikakuhumira ujumbe uhu bwana wangu, ili ukubali kunikaribisha.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara ahumwa ariphouya kpwa Jakobo, amuamba, “Hwafika kpwa mwenenu Esau na vivi a njirani aredza mkutane; aredza na alume magana mane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo waogopha sana na achikala na wasiwasi. Achiganya atue, mbuzi, ngʼombe, mangʼondzi na ngamia makundi mairi-mairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaza achiamba, “Esau achedzapigana na kundi mwenga, rira ndirosala rinaweza kuchimbira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Jakobo wavoya Mlungu achiamba, “Ee Mlungu wa tsawe Burahimu na baba Isaka. Mwenyezi Mlungu yeniamba, ‘Uya kpwenu kpwa mbarizo nami nindakuhendera manono.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sifwaha kuonyeswa mendzwa isiyosika, wala uaminifu ambao ukanionyesa mimi mtumishio. Awali nriphovuka huno muho Joridani navuka na fwimbo tu, ela vivi hu makundi mairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuvoya unitivye na uyi wa mwenehu Esau, mana naogopha asedze akahupiga na kuhuangamiza hosi, hata anache na nine zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.22.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 22:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe mwenye waniahidi uchiniamba, ‘Nindakujaliya na nindakupha uvyazi munji dza mtsanga wa pwani ambao mutu kaweza kuuolanga.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usikuwe Jakobo wakala phapho hipho na achitenga mifugoye yanjina ikale zawadi ya nduguye Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watenga vitu hivi: Magoma ga mbuzi magana mairi, ndenje mirongo miiri, mangʼondzi machetu magana mairi, turume mirongo miiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngamia aamwisao mirongo mihahu na ana ao, ngʼombe chetu mirongo mine, ndzau kumi, punda achetu mirongo miiri na punda alume kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waika chila mfugo kundire na chila kundi waririchira mtumishiwe arimanyirire. Achiaambira, “Tanguliyani, na chila kundi narikale hatuwa na kundi ranjina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamlagiza yuya ariye mbere, achimuamba, “Wakati uchikutana na mwenehu Esau, na achikuuza, ‘Tajirio ni ani? Unaphiyaphi? Huno mfugo ni wa ani?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe undamjibu umuambe, ‘Huno mfugo ni mali ya mtumishio Jakobo na ni zawadiyo uwe bwana wangu Esau; na ye mwenye aredza ko nyuma.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya wamlagiza vivyo mtumishi wa kundi ra phiri, ra hahu na osi ariokala nyuma ya go makundi achiaamba, “Muambireni Esau vivyo hivyo mchikutana naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona, msiyale kumuambira Esau, ‘Mtumishio Jakobo aredza ko nyuma.’ ” Jakobo waona andamhuriza na zira zawadi na achikutana naye mendzerepho andamswamehe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo, Jakobo watanguliza zira zawadi ela ye mwenye walala pho kambini usiku uho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usiku uho, Jakobo walamuka na achihala achee osi airi, hara atumishie a chichetu airi na anae kumi na mwenga, achiavusa riko ra Jaboki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya kuavusa, wavusa malize zosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.12.3+HOS.12.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hosea 12:3–4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela iye mwenye, wasala macheye phapho, watsembukirwa ni mutu, achibwagana naye hadi pepho za kucha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya mutu ariphoona kaweza kumshinda Jakobo, wampiga chibiruni achihemuka nyonga wakati achere minyana naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha yuya mutu achiamba, “Nirichira niphiye mana kunacha.” Ela Jakobo achimuamba, “Sikurichira hadi unibariki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya mutu achimuuza, “Ndiwe ani?” Jakobo achimuamba, “Ndimi Jakobo.” ",
